        "evidence_id": "E001",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Order, Supreme Court, New York County (Robert David Kalish, J.), entered on or about October 7, 2019, which, to the extent appealed from as limited by the briefs, denied the motion of defendant Driton LLC for summary judgment dismissing the complaint as against it, unanimously affirmed, without costs.",
        "statement_status": "current_disposition"
