      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P002",
        "quote": "The court also properly found that, given the conflicting expert opinions as to the extent a chipped or repaired floor tile proximately caused plaintiff's accident, there is a triable issue as to whether the defect on the platform was trivial as a matter of law",
