        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Order, Supreme Court, Bronx County (Dawn Jimenez-Salta, J.), entered December 15, 2021, which denied defendant's motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint, unanimously affirmed, without costs.",
