        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Plaintiff was injured when she tripped and fell over a plastic shopping basket on the floor of the supermarket that defendant owned and operated. The shopping basket was placed on the floor near the customer service podium, and as plaintiff was talking to an employee there, she stepped to her left and tripped over the basket.",
