        "quote": "Defendant failed to establish its prima facie entitlement to judgment as a matter of law, since the record presents an issue of fact as to whether the shopping basket constituted an open and obvious condition that was not inherently dangerous ( see Simo v City of New York , 205 AD3d 508 , 509 [1st Dept 2022]). The photographs and surveillance footage of the accident do not allow a determination as a matter of law that the shopping basket was plainly observable and posed no danger to a person making reasonable use of her senses",
